{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>He that gathered much and he that gathered little.</b> Some gathered much and some gathered little, and when they came home each one measured what he had gathered by the omer, and they found that the one who gathered much had no excess over an omer per person in his tent, and the one who gathered little was not short of an omer per person — and this is a great miracle that was done in it."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:41.343844543Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}